    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 3.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif mæssepreost folc miswyssige æt freolse oððe æt fæstene, gylde XXX scill' mid Englum ⁊ mid Denum þreo healfmarc.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a mass priest misdirects the people with regard to a festival or fast, he shall pay 30 shillings in an English district, and 3 half-marks in a Danish district.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf mæssepreost folc miswissige æt freolse oððe æt fæstene, gylde XXX scill' mid Englum ⁊ mid Denum ðreo healfmarc.</ab>
      </div>
